# apt mirrorlist: Ubuntu security updates.
#
# Edit this file in place for your site; rebuild points apt here
# directly (path derived from the repo location).
#
# One URI per line; apt tries them in order with automatic failover.
#
# Security updates are best taken from the canonical host to avoid mirror
# lag; add a local mirror above it only if it syncs security promptly.
http://security.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/
